# Everything the driver produces when it builds this fixture, should anyone run
# kivyforge here by hand: the wheels it builds from deps/, the locks (whose
# hashes are of those wheels, so they change on every run), a development
# egg-info, and each platform's build output.
wheels/
pylock.*.toml
*.egg-info
build/
dist/
metaprobe-app-ios/
metaprobe-app-android/
